sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Lead as Team Lead
    participant WO as WorkOrder
    participant RW as ResourceWindow
    participant IDX as EvidenceIndexer
    participant ROOT as RootSelectorTester
    participant PATH as PathAuditor
    participant PORTAL as PortalRegressionRunner
    participant LEDGER as LedgerProjector
    participant RUNBOOK as RunbookBuilder
    participant PLATFORM as PlatformGate
    participant FS as ReadOnly Filesystem
    participant APPROVAL as ApprovalDecision

    Lead->>WO: create GOV-MIN-001..007 with scope and forbidden paths
    WO->>RW: validate existing read-only governance window
    RW-->>WO: allow read-only docs/code scans; deny production writes

    par Independent read-only work
        WO->>IDX: execute GOV-MIN-001
        IDX->>FS: scan docs/governance and referenced evidence
        FS-->>IDX: paths, existence, mtimes, hashes
        IDX-->>WO: evidence-index report (MISSING preserved)
    and
        WO->>ROOT: execute GOV-MIN-002 in temp fixture
        ROOT->>FS: create isolated fixture roots
        FS-->>ROOT: catalog/root scenarios
        ROOT-->>WO: selector coverage matrix; no production launcher
    and
        WO->>PATH: execute GOV-MIN-003
        PATH->>FS: search hard-coded E: paths and call sites
        FS-->>PATH: locations and context
        PATH-->>WO: migration matrix; uncertain rows blocked
    and
        WO->>PORTAL: execute GOV-MIN-004
        PORTAL->>FS: read route source, baseline, export_nav, mixin tests
        FS-->>PORTAL: route diff and source/export comparison
        PORTAL-->>WO: regression report; no baseline rebuild
    and
        WO->>LEDGER: execute GOV-MIN-005
        LEDGER->>FS: read ledger snapshots and calculate hashes
        FS-->>LEDGER: raw/current records
        LEDGER-->>WO: external projection; source immutable
    and
        WO->>RUNBOOK: execute GOV-MIN-006
        RUNBOOK->>FS: read verified port/process/health evidence
        FS-->>RUNBOOK: facts and timestamps
        RUNBOOK-->>WO: runbook drafts with UNVERIFIED markers
    and
        WO->>PLATFORM: execute GOV-MIN-007
        PLATFORM->>FS: probe independent zhice-os-v2 tree and pytest
        FS-->>PLATFORM: environment availability
        PLATFORM-->>WO: test matrix or BLOCKED report
    end

    WO->>WO: validate deliverables, reproducibility, no runtime writes
    alt production/shared write requested
        WO->>APPROVAL: request explicit decision and window
        APPROVAL-->>WO: blocked until signed approval + snapshot + rollback
    else read-only deliverable complete
        WO-->>Lead: close with evidence paths and rollback instructions
    end
